<%# What the feed shows in place of the cards when the selected combination
    of segments is under the small-cell threshold — see
    ResolvesResultSegments#combine_result_segments, which has already
    emptied the scope and zeroed the count by the time this renders, so the
    only thing left to do here is say why there is nothing to see and what
    to do about it. Rendered by the owner's results page and the public
    shared one alike: the rule is the same on both, and so is the notice. %>
<div class="rc-card rc-suppressed" role="status">
  <div class="rc-suppressed-title">🔒 <%= t("results.combination_suppressed_title") %></div>
  <div class="rc-suppressed-body"><%= t("results.combination_suppressed_body", count: ResolvesResultSegments::MIN_DEMOGRAPHIC_SAMPLE) %></div>
</div>
